"""Icon for the "Умный дом" tab - generated file, do not edit by hand.

Astra accepts only an SVG string for a tab icon (the `icon_svg` field of
@ui_page/UiContribution), so the plugin's main icon.png is embedded here as a
PNG data URI, downscaled to 48px: the tab icon matches the store card icon.
The markup carries no scripts and no off-machine references, which the registry
would reject.

To refresh after replacing icon.png, re-encode it at 48x48 px into this same
wrapper: <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><image width="48" height="48"
href="data:image/png;base64,..."/></svg>
"""

TAB_ICON_SVG = '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="Yandex Smart Home"><image x="0" y="0" width="48" height="48" href="data:image/png;base64,"/></svg>'
